units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
lattice fcc 3.52
region box block 0 10 0 10 0 10
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
mass 1 58.6934
pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * /scratch/gilbreth/holbrooe/LAMMPS-AST/publication/potentials/prompt2.potential Ni
velocity all create 600.0 12345 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
timestep 0.001
thermo 100
thermo_style custom step temp press pe ke etotal vol
fix 1 all npt temp 300.0 2500.0 0.1 iso 1.0 1.0 1.0
run 10
